 that may apply.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#状态免疫#LAST#\n大部分状态效果可以被特定的免疫来抵消，以百分比表示你完全免疫该效果的几率。这一几率会与任何适用的豁免或其他判定叠加计算。\n"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}